      "id": 230257,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-04-14T12:53:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Luck indeed! :B</p>\n<p>First game, I took out Greazer right quick, because being KNYFE's nemesis is one of the classic blunders. Unfortunately, this led to a slow, painful slide into rat-induced failure over the next several turns.</p>\n<p>So next time, I focused on Plague Rat. And it took some doing, Bastion and all, but eventually KNYFE died, so Greazer was already taken care of. Then I took out Plague Rat on Greazer's turn thanks to Sentinel&nbsp;Tactics. I also took out Friction on Greazer's turn when she was the only villain left and had 1 HP. XD So it was quite the weird game.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:05:12.712Z",
