      "created_at": "2020-04-14T13:50:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I used Blackouts on the Rat when there were no handlers. He really tore through the villains with that. Lost te Idealist, and everyone else was low single digits, but a win in a win. Order was Anvil (because Bastion was played), Greazer, Hammer, Friction/Plague Rat in the last turn. The environment was a complete non event.</p>",
