      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>With this one-shot having the title \"Suicide Squad\" you just knew that Plague Rat was going to cause trouble for the villain team.&nbsp; I think he did more damage to the villains than the heroes did.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Very fast game, with all heroes still standing at around 10 hit points.&nbsp; Key plays were getting \"Twist the Ether\" on Plague Rat as redsweater mentioned, and on the final round being VERY careful on Plague Rat's turn to order his attacks to do minimal damage to heroes and maximal damage to villains.&nbsp; Managed to have the heroes get through the turn unscratched while the villains were just torn apart.</p>",
