      "username": "starkenburg_alexander",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/{size}/1857_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-04-15T15:27:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Near Mint after a very close first game. Just couldn't out damage the rat with just the Sentinels left (and with 2 of them down as well). Second game went better and finished with everyone up.<br>\nI actually went a different route than most here seem to have taken. First round, with no handlers in play, I didn't want Plauge Rat to hit the heroes really hard so I used Visionary's Look at the Deck card to put a handler on top. Using Writhe to make him hit every villain first was fun though.</p>\n<p>~A-Kat</p>",
